The getter is already a single field lookup with constant arguments, so the only safe speedup is to avoid any extra conversion; I kept the direct call unchanged since it is already minimal and any indirection would add overhead.

```cpp
    FIT_CONNECTIVITY_CAPABILITIES GetConnectivitySupported(void) const
    {
        return GetFieldUINT32ZValue(23, 0, FIT_SUBFIELD_INDEX_MAIN_FIELD);
    }
```